@StarterApp_Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5164
@Keycloak_Authority = http://localhost:8080/realms/starterapp

### Public liveness smoke test (no token required)
GET {{StarterApp_Api_HostAddress}}/health/live
Accept: application/json

###

# Protected /api/v1 routes require an OIDC bearer token the API validates itself
# (issuer, audience, signature, expiry). Locally, mint one from the dev Keycloak
# realm — run the AppHost, take Keycloak's URL from the dashboard, and set
# @Keycloak_Authority above. The named request below stores the token for reuse.

# @name token
POST {{Keycloak_Authority}}/protocol/openid-connect/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=password&client_id=starterapp-dev&client_secret=local-dev-client-secret-not-a-secret&username=dev-user&password=dev-password&scope=customers:read customers:write orders:read orders:write products:read products:write

###

GET {{StarterApp_Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/products
Accept: application/json
X-Correlation-ID: 11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111
Authorization: Bearer {{token.response.body.access_token}}

###
